WireTuner: librevenge without Boost (docs/spec/decisions.adoc D-083).
RVNGPropertyList.cpp: the Boost.Spirit number, unit and boolean parsers are replaced by
strtod_l in the C locale, std::from_chars and plain comparisons with the same grammar.
RVNGBinaryData.cpp: Boost's base64 iterators and boost::trim are replaced by a plain codec
and trim.

